{"id": "22598", "title": "乐府杂录", "author": "段安节", "category": "文学名著", "count": 47, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/22/22598/22598s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/22/22598.htm", "intro": "全书共一卷。唐段安节撰。主要是对开元以后音乐、歌舞、俳优、乐器等问题的考证，并录有歌舞艺人，可考知有唐一代音乐体制的变化，是研究唐代后期礼乐制度、音乐、舞蹈、戏曲发展轨迹的宝贵资料，可补《教坊记》之不足。在“唐时乐制，绝无传者”的情况下，该书被《唐书》、《文献通考》、《乐府诗集》多所采纳。\r\n　　版本：1957年古典文学出版社本。", "base": "files/article/html/22/22598", "chapters": [{"title": "序 雅乐部", "file": "1657209.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 云韶乐", "file": "1657210.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 清乐部", "file": "1657211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 鼓吹部", "file": "1657212.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 驱傩", "file": "1657213.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 熊罴部", "file": "1657214.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 鼓架部", "file": "1657215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 龟兹部", "file": "1657216.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 胡部", "file": "1657217.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 歌", "file": "1657218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 舞工", "file": "1657219.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 俳优", "file": "1657220.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 琵琶", "file": "1657221.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 筝", "file": "1657222.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 箜篌", "file": "1657223.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 笙", "file": "1657224.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 笛", "file": "1657225.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 觱篥", "file": "1657226.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 五弦", "file": "1657227.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 方响", "file": "1657228.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 击瓯", "file": "1657229.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 琴", "file": "1657230.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 阮咸", "file": "1657231.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 羯鼓", "file": "1657232.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序 鼓", "file": "1657233.html"